OpenLogi 0.8.14: combined device UI fixes (source only)

Combines PR #1228 and PR #1830, including the incomplete-probe review fix.
https://github.com/AprilNEA/OpenLogi/pull/1228
https://github.com/AprilNEA/OpenLogi/pull/1830

Base: v0.8.14 (c542cd7e7df16d6c992d4ccc6ed3e65e5c4f222f).
Replaces patch-1228.diff and patch-1830.diff; do not apply those separately.
Test changes and unrelated upstream commits are excluded.
The separate MacPorts cargo-build-target patch is still required.

